<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the</p>
<p>second day of four-day Red Stripe Cup cricket matches on</p>
<p>Saturday:</p>
<p>At Discovery Bay, Jamaica: Barbados 184 and 139-5 Jamaica</p>
<p>180 (H.Bryan 4-42).</p>
<p>At The Valley, Anguilla: Leeward Islands 168 and 23-2.</p>
<p>Windward Islands 199.</p>
<p>At Port of Spain: Trinidad and Tobago 305 (P.Simons 78,</p>
<p>L.Roberts 65; N.McGarrell 7-84). Guyana 183-5 (S.Chanderpaul 60,</p>
<p>N.Degroot 53).</p>
